{"id":"d76c8b012650fb73","group":"29","path":"29/29-cor-ph-so.md","title":"PH=SO","display":"cor-ph-so — PH=SO","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-cor-ph-so","aliases":["29-cor-ph-so"],"display":"cor-ph-so — PH=SO","depends_on":["[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","[[29-df-ph]]","[[29-df-so-hierarchy]]","[[29-thm-ph-equivalence]]"],"source_locator":"Corollary 7.22, pp.121–122, DjVu scans 136–137","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；陈述已核对，证明范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-cor-ph-so"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-cor-ph-so</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-ph-so — PH=SO"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9120c20ece14d350\" href=\"?note=9120c20ece14d350\" title=\"29-df-ph\">29-df-ph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7bd2cd8b0f2698f9\" href=\"?note=7bd2cd8b0f2698f9\" title=\"29-df-so-hierarchy\">29-df-so-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e052662a4a07aa17\" href=\"?note=e052662a4a07aa17\" title=\"29-thm-ph-equivalence\">29-thm-ph-equivalence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Corollary 7.22, pp.121–122, DjVu scans 136–137"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；陈述已核对，证明范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> (词汇表, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9120c20ece14d350\" href=\"?note=9120c20ece14d350\" title=\"29-df-ph\">29-df-ph</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_k^p[\\tau],\\Pi_k^p[\\tau],\\mathrm{PH}[\\tau]\">\\(\\Sigma_k^p[\\tau],\\Pi_k^p[\\tau],\\mathrm{PH}[\\tau]\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9120c20ece14d350\" href=\"?note=9120c20ece14d350\" title=\"29-df-ph\">29-df-ph</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(\\Sigma_k^1)[\\tau],Q(\\Pi_k^1)[\\tau]\">\\(Q(\\Sigma_k^1)[\\tau],Q(\\Pi_k^1)[\\tau]\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7bd2cd8b0f2698f9\" href=\"?note=7bd2cd8b0f2698f9\" title=\"29-df-so-hierarchy\">29-df-so-hierarchy</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau]\">\\(Q(\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau]\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ph\\text{-}so}\\vdash\\mathrm{PH}[\\tau]=Q(\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ph\\text{-}so}\\vdash\\mathrm{PH}[\\tau]=Q(\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ph\\text{-}so}\\vdash\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\Bigl(\\Sigma_k^p[\\tau]=Q(\\Sigma_k^1)[\\tau]\\land\\Pi_k^p[\\tau]=Q(\\Pi_k^1)[\\tau]\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ph\\text{-}so}\\vdash\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\Bigl(\\Sigma_k^p[\\tau]=Q(\\Sigma_k^1)[\\tau]\\land\\Pi_k^p[\\tau]=Q(\\Pi_k^1)[\\tau]\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条保留为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e052662a4a07aa17\" href=\"?note=e052662a4a07aa17\" title=\"29-thm-ph-equivalence\">29-thm-ph-equivalence</a> 的历史入口，层次刻画与其并集结论来自原书 Theorem 7.21、Corollary 7.22。两份正文的重复结论不计作独立数学结果。完整 oracle 对应证明的核验限制见标准入口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ph","status":"resolved","id":"9120c20ece14d350","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ph]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-so-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"7bd2cd8b0f2698f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-so-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-ph-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"e052662a4a07aa17","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-ph-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ph","status":"resolved","id":"9120c20ece14d350","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau$ (词汇表, see [[29-df-ph]])","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ph","status":"resolved","id":"9120c20ece14d350","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_k^p[\\tau],\\Pi_k^p[\\tau],\\mathrm{PH}[\\tau]$ (see [[29-df-ph]])","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-so-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"7bd2cd8b0f2698f9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Q(\\Sigma_k^1)[\\tau],Q(\\Pi_k^1)[\\tau]$ (see [[29-df-so-hierarchy]])","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt"